  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\n4 & 6 Riddell Road, Glendowie | 10 Brand-New Freehold Homes\r\n\r\nThe developer has given clear instructions: these homes are completed, priced to sell, and ready for your offer today.\r\n\r\nOffering exceptional value in a high-end coastal suburb, this collection of 12 brand-new residences delivers the perfect balance of accessible pricing, spacious design, and zero-maintenance living. Whether you are looking for a versatile home for growing family life, an effortless venue for weekend entertaining, or a rock-solid long-term investment in a top location, this development meets every requirement.\r\n\r\nSmart Design & Maximum Functionality\r\n\r\n• Generous Living Space: Generous floor plans spanning 166m² to 222m² (including balcony space).\r\n• Flexible Layouts: Primarily 3 bedrooms plus a dedicated study/flexi-room (or 4-bedroom options) to suit families,   guests, or working from home.\r\n• 3 Full Bathrooms: Beautifully finished, modern bathrooms in every residence to make busy mornings seamless.\r\n• Internal Garaging: Secure single, tandem, and coveted double internal access garages.\r\n• Entertainer’s Hub: Light-filled, open-plan living and dining anchored by sleek designer kitchens with quality             appliances.\r\n• Sunlit Outdoor Areas: Low-maintenance private outdoor spaces ideal for summer BBQs and relaxation.\r\nFreehold Security: Freehold titles with no body corporate fees.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Eastern Bays Location\r\n\r\nSurrounded by tree-lined streets, popular parks, and excellent local amenities, this location delivers long-term capital stability and unmatched lifestyle appeal.\r\n\r\n• Top Educational Zoning: In zone for prestigious St Heliers School and Glendowie College.\r\n• Beaches & Village Vibe: Just minutes from St Heliers Village, sandy beaches, waterfront cafes, and dining.\r\n• City Commute: Conveniently located near direct bus routes for an easy trip into the Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nThe Developer Is Ready to Sell—Make Your Move Now\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a brand-new, spacious home in Glendowie at this level do not last long. Early buyers get the first choice of layouts.\r\n\r\nBring your family, explore three distinct floor plans on-site, and present your offer today.",
